              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 7:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hurira, iwe Israeli! Noija kwambuka Yorudani eri izooba kunyaga amahanga agarikukukira ekitiinisa n'amaani, endembo mpango, ezeehinguririziibwe engo ezizitiire okuhika ahaiguru munonga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'abantu bahango kandi baraingwa beene Anaki, abu orikumanya, kandi abu orahuriire nibagambaho bati: N'oha orikubaasa kuza aba Anaki omu kaso? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
