          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TI.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tim 1:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "TIT.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tit 3:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 13:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Torikuza omu nsi yaabo kugikubuura ahabw'okuhikiirira kwawe nari okugororoka kw'omutima gwawe, kureka ahabw'obubi bw'ago mahanga nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arikubabingira omu maisho gaawe, kandi ngu abone kuhamya ekigambo eki yaarahiire naaraganisa baashwenkuru, Abrahamu, Isaaka na Yakobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo omanye MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ku atarikukuha nsi egi kugikubuura ahabw'okuhikiirira kwawe; ahabw'okuba ori eihanga ery'ebitsya bigangaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 14:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.16.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.17.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oijukye, kandi oteebwa oku waitsize MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ekiniga omu ihamba; okwiha aha izooba eri waarugiireho omu nsi ya Misri, n'okuhitsya obu muhikire aha, mukaba mugomera MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 32:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi n'ahari Horebu mukaitsizaho MUKAMA ekiniga, yaabagirira ekiniga, yaayenda kubacwekyereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku nainamukire aha rushozi kwakiira ebishate biri eby'amabaare, nibyo bishate by'endagaano ei MUKAMA yaaragaine naimwe, naamara ahari orwo rushozi ebiro makumi ana nyomushana na nyekiro; nkaba ntarya kintu kyona, n'obu kwakuba okunywa amaizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yampa ebyo bishate bibiri by'amabaare ebihandiiikirweho orukumu rwa Ruhanga; bikaba biriho ebigambo byona ebi MUKAMA agambiire naimwe ahari orwo rushozi, ari ahagati omu muriro, aha izooba ry'okuteeraniraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo biro makumi ana ku byahweire, MUKAMA yampa ebyo bishate bibiri by'amabaare, nibyo bishate by'endagaano; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 32:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yangira ati: Imuka, orugye aha, orahukye oshuume; ahabw'okuba abantu baawe abu waihire Misri, beesiisire; baarahuka kuteishuka omuhanda, ogu naabaragiire kutoora; baayeheeshera ekishushani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi MUKAMA yangira ati: Ndeebire eihanga eri, reeba n'eihanga ry'ebitsya bigangaire; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 32:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " reka mbacwekyereze, eiziina ryabo ryebere kimwe ahansi y'eiguru, nkuhindure eihanga eririkubakiza amaani n'ekitiinisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naanye naahinduka, naaruga aha rushozi, kandi orwo rushozi rukaba nirwaka omuriro; ebyo bishate bibiri by'amabaare nkaba mbiine omu ngaro zombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku naayetegyereize, naareeba mucumwire ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, mweheesheire ekishushani ky'enyana omu zaabu, muteishukire omuhanda ogu MUKAMA yaabaire abaragiire kutoora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naakwata ebyo bishate bibiri by'amabaare, ebyabaire bindi omu ngaro zombi, naabiteera ahansi, naabyatira omu maisho gaanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.106.23"
              },
              "items": [
