              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi MUKAMA yaagirira Arooni ekiniga kingi, yaayenda kumwita; omuri obwo bunaku na Arooni nawe naamushabira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
