        },
        {
          "text": " Naakwata ekibi kyanyu, nikyo kishushani ky'enyana eki mwaheesire, naakyotsya omu muriro, naakihondahonda, naakisa, naakicwa obunono; esaano yaakyo naaginaga omu kagyera, akaabaire nikaruga omu rushozi.",
