        {
          "text": " Kandi n'obu MUKAMA yaabatumira Kadeshi-barunea, naagira ati: Mwinamukye, mukubuure ensi ei mbahaire; nabwo mukagomera ekiragiro kya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, timwamwikiriza, n'obu kwakuba okumuhurira. ",
